      "title": "Legacy Tenant Onboarding: Handling Duplicate Accounts in Identity Vault",
      "content_summary": "Addresses duplicate account creation during tenant setup when provisioning appears stuck, requiring manual reconciliation with Chargeback Handler.",
      "content_body": "During the initial tenant setup phase in Identity Vault, operators may inadvertently trigger multiple provisioning requests, resulting in duplicate account records. This often causes the Chargeback Handler to stall as it cannot uniquely resolve the account ID for billing association. To resolve this, perform a manual reconciliation by cross-referencing the creation timestamps and deleting the secondary account record. Ensure the primary account is correctly mapped in the Chargeback Handler before releasing the stuck provisioning job."
